        "$=a(a+2b)+4(2b-3c)+a(4-3c)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "那么，得到的各项不含有公因式．因此，这种分组法不能解决",
        "我们的问题．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "还存在这样的多项式，一般说来它不能化成次数不小于",
        "$1$ 的两个多项式之积的形式．二项式 $x^2+1$ 就是这种多项式",
        "的例子．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "845",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "845．分解因式：",
        "а) $a(b+c)+3(b+c)$；　　б) $5(x-y)-y(x-y)$；",
        "в) $y(a-c)+5a-5c$；　　г) $z(c-d)+c-d$；",
        "д) $a(p-q)+p-q$；　　е) $n(c+p)+c+p$；",
        "ж) $kx+ky-n(x+y)$；　　з) $t(s-u)-ks+ku$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "846",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "846．把多项式化成二项式的积：",
        "а) $mx+my+10x+10y$；",
        "б) $9x+9y+ax+ay$；",
        "в) $7a-7b+an-bn$；",
        "г) $ac+bc-2a-2b$；",
        "д) $a^2-ab-8a+8b$；",
        "е) $11x+11y-x^2-xy$；",
        "ж) $x^2+ax-a^2y-axy$；",
        "з) $a^2n-anx+x^2-ax$；",
        "и) $5a^3c+10a^2-6bc-3abc^2$；",
        "к) $8xy^3-24y^2-7axy+21a$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
